consin/rusk-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Rusk County came in under 90% of normal for January to February in 39 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle got 42% of normal in September to October. In 2026 so far, May to June sits at 63% on the middle. Grid 30754 had its driest year in 1976 at 53%.</p>"}
